   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear all, <div><br></div><div>My Shiny App is working perfectly fine with no errors in R in external view, but gives the following error after deploying it to Shinyapps.io online :</div><div><br></div><div>Application unexpectedly exited, Diagnostic information has been dumped to the Javascript console. </div><div><br></div><div>This happens as soon as the page opens, I have no idea on how to fix this. Any ideas? </div><div>Thanks a lot, </div><div>Thibault </div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "CUFTGRo2UsAJ",
   "from": "Thibault Putseys",
   "author": "22e0ebd10275e4ac",
   "date": "2014-08-08T13:38:30Z",
   "subject": "Re: App not working after deployApp()",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Ok found the error myself, <div><br></div><div>I was using a shortcut to load in libraries, but apparantly, he doesn&#39;t build all necessary libraries that way when running deployApp().<br><br><br>Op vrijdag 8 augustus 2014 09:58:44 UTC+2 schreef Thibault Putseys:</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Dear all, <div><br></div><div>My Shiny App is working perfectly fine with no errors in R in external view, but gives the following error after deploying it to Shinyapps.io online :</div><div><br></div><div>Application unexpectedly exited, Diagnostic information has been dumped to the Javascript console. </div><div><br></div><div>This happens as soon as the page opens, I have no idea on how to fix this. Any ideas? </div><div>Thanks a lot, </div><div>Thibault </div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
