    [
     1,
     "Can you explain what you mean? When I deploy my app and the browser launches, a white screen appears with the text &quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\">ERROR: unable to install packages&quot;.</span><div><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><br></span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Do you know how to properly install the packages. Here is my session info: </span></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\"><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sessionInfo</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>R version </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3.1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2014</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">07</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Platform</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> x86_64</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">apple</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">darwin13</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">64</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">bit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>locale</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</sp