/span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">10.1</span><span style=\"color:#000\">    <br><br>loaded via a </span><span style=\"color:#008\">namespace</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">and</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">not</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> attached</span><span style=\"color:#660\">):</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> bitops_1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#000\">    caTools_1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">17</span><span style=\"color:#000\">    digest_0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6.4</span><span style=\"color:#000\">    htmltools_0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2.4</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> httpuv_1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3.0</span><span style=\"color:#000\">   <br> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Rcpp_0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">11.2</span><span style=\"color:#000\">     </span><span style=\"color:#606\">RCurl_1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">95</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">4.1</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  RJSONIO_1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#000\">   tools_3</span><span style=\"c